513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (1. Executive Summary )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
514 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (The AI-Based Healthcare Chatbot System is a web-based application designed to provide basic healthcare assistance through an interactive conversational interface. It enables users to input symptoms and receive instant responses, helping them understand common health conditions and possible precautions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
515 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (The system is developed using Python with the Flask framework for backend processing, while the frontend is built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It follows a client-server architecture where user inputs are sent to the server, processed using chatbot logic, and returned as meaningful responses.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (The chatbot operates on a rule-based mechanism, where predefined keywords are matched with user input to generate appropriate replies. It can handle common symptoms such as fever, cold, and headache, providing general advice like rest, hydration, and medical consultation when necessary.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
517 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (The system is lightweight, easy to use, and provides quick responses, making it suitable for basic healthcare guidance. Testing shows that it performs efficiently for simple queries, though it is limited by its predefined knowledge base and cannot provide advanced medical diagnosis.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (In conclusion, this project demonstrates the effective use of chatbot technology in healthcare applications and highlights its potential for future enhancement using advanced artificial intelligence and natural language processing techniques.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
