/E (2. Background )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
527 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (The aim of this project is to develop a healthcare chatbot that provides basic medical guidance by analyzing user symptoms and generating appropriate responses using a rule-based approach.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1893 0 R
/E (To design and develop an AI-based healthcare chatbot system)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1894 0 R
/E (To provide basic medical guidance for common health issues)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1895 0 R
/E (To enable users to interact through a simple and user-friendly interface)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1896 0 R
/E (To process user input and generate appropriate responses)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (The rapid growth of digital technology has significantly transformed the healthcare sector, making services more accessible and efficient. One such advancement is the use of chatbot systems, which are designed to simulate human conversation and provide automated responses to user queries. These systems are increasingly being used in healthcare to assist patients with basic information, symptom checking, and general guidance.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (Traditionally, individuals had to rely on direct consultation with healthcare professionals even for minor health concerns. This often leads to overcrowding in hospitals, increased waiting times, and unnecessary pressure on medical staff. In many cases, people may delay seeking advice due to inconvenience, cost, or lack of access to medical facilities. As a result, there is a growing need for systems that can provide immediate and basic healthcare support.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
534 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (Healthcare chatbots address this gap by offering instant responses and continuous availability. They can guide users by analyzing symptoms and suggesting possible actions, such as rest, hydration, or consulting a doctor. While advanced chatbot systems use artificial intelligence and natural language processing, simpler rule-based systems are still effective for handling common queries.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (This project focuses on developing a rule-based healthcare chatbot system that provides quick and user-friendly assistance. By integrating web technologies with backend processing, the system demonstrates how digital tools can support healthcare services and improve user accessibility.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
