1032 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 434 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates the successful development of a web-based natural language interface for healthcare infrastructure. It validates full-stack concepts by integrating a structured frontend, REST-style backend, and persistent data layer into one coherent system.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1033 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 434 0 R
/E (The implemented architecture supports practical healthcare functionalities such as patient query handling, symptom understanding, and chatbot-based guidance. The system also emphasizes maintainability through modular code organization and clear separation of responsibilities.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1034 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 434 0 R
/E (From an academic perspective, the project satisfies objectives related to software design, implementation, testing, user interface development, and system evaluation. It also provides a strong foundation for future enhancements such as advanced medical diagnosis support, integration with hospital systems, and telemedicine services.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
