/Title (The proposed system is a web-based healthcare application designed to improve accessibility and interaction within healthcare infrastructure using a natural language interface. The system enables patients to communicate with healthcare services through simple text-based queries, eliminating the need for complex navigation or technical knowledge. Users can perform essential operations such as viewing doctor details, checking availability, booking appointments, and receiving assistance through an integrated chatbot. The chatbot plays a key role in the system by understanding user input and providing relevant responses related to healthcare services, appointment status, and general information.)
